Support DNS client CIDRs in FakeIP filter rules, including TUN hijack.

Based on upstream PR: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/2894
Pass a typed source through the existing DNS relay and publish the active
service atomically. Keep source handling in separate files where possible.
Preserve domain-only provider metadata and skip address extraction on DNS
listeners when the filter does not use the client address.

